This is rlhf-from-scratch — a comparative study of post-training methods
(SFT, DPO, PPO, GRPO) at the 0.5B-1.5B scale.

- Use PyTorch and Hugging Face TRL for training.
- Prefer uv for package management.
- All training runs should log to W&B under project "rlhf-from-scratch".
- Models default to Qwen2.5-0.5B unless specified.
- Maintain consistent base model and eval harness across experiments —
  comparisons must be apples-to-apples.
- Comments explain *why*, not *what*.
